"often the case), this will result in a loop: :program:`qvm-open-in-dvm` will "
"attempt to execute :program:`qubes.OpenURL` in a new disposable, but that "
"will in turn execute :program:`qvm-open-in-dvm`. A question dialog will "
"appear to confirm if this is the intended behavior or not."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/disposable-customization.rst:119
#: ffd2d7eed0e743549ef8e50b267db096
